            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Isa 13.1–14.23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.47.1+ISA.47.2+ISA.47.3+ISA.47.4+ISA.47.5+ISA.47.6+ISA.47.7+ISA.47.8+ISA.47.9+ISA.47.10+ISA.47.11+ISA.47.12+ISA.47.13+ISA.47.14+ISA.47.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "47.1-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ele rorei eiroro Olaitoriani neipirta Babilon eipirta enkop oo Lkaldayo eimunye Yeremia ilo oiboni le Nkai ejo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amu moikuape eing'uaa enkop nalotu aarare ninye, naa ninye nalotu aitaa enkop enye mitil, nemeitoki hoo ng'ae amanya; keisik oltung'ani o eng'ues aailanyisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Errinyunoto e Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore kenya te nena olong'i o teina kata, Olaitoriani ojo, ore iltung'ana le Israel o ltung'ana le Yuda, nepuonu tenebo, neishir ninche epuonu neing'oru Olaitoriani Enkai enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuanu ninche enkoitoi nalo Sion, eibelekenya nkomomi enye aaing'or ina alo, ejo, ‘Wootu, matushulare iyiook Olaitoriani tiatua osotua loo ntarasi lemerikinishoi ae kata.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Etaa apa iltung'ana laainei ntare naaimina, etorikoitie ninche ilairritak lenye aaitapong'oo, aaibelekeny ninche too ldoinyo nepuo ninche oldoinyo o endoinyo, etorikine ninche eluaata enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki oonoto ninche neinosa ninche, netejo ilmang'ati lenye, Eitu iyiook kintarruoo; amu etaasa ninche eng'oki tialo Olaitoriani, laa ninye emanyisho enye nadede, Olaitoriani osiligi loo loo papaai lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
