            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 18.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Esika entung'uai empolos e Babilon, nipuopuo aaipang te nkop oo Lkaldayo, nitiuu anaa iloroi te dukuya iluaat oo ntare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ng'ura, kadumu nanu nayau metaarare Babilon olorora kitok loo loreren oogol, ooing'uaa enkop e moikuape; naa keitobirakino ninche olarrabal pee earare ninche; ore teine neyae ninye. Eikununo mbaa enye anaa olmurrani arriyia lemeshukunye ninye too nkaik naarook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku kepuo Ikaldayo eyararoto; ore lelo pooki ooraya ninye netum pooki toki, Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embatatata e Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore hoo ning'ida, ore hoo nirup kewan, intae ilararok le njung'ore ai, ore hoo nintigiran anaa enkashe too nkujit, ninchirishiri anaa oloing'oni le mbarta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keitukurruni ng'utunyi katukul, ore apa ina natoiwuo intae nesuli. Ee, keaku ninye e nesiadi too loreren, ong'ata natoyio naa olpurkel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkaraki engoro o Laitoriani memanyi ninye, kake keaku olmuaate mijooni; ore pooki ng'ae ogiroo Babilon neiputukuny, neing'asia te nkaraki ilbaa lenyena pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Entobirakinoto pee iararere Babilon aaman aamuat te pooki shoto, intae pooki ooriu enkawuo, entang'or ninye, mileku mbaa, amu etaasa ninye eng'oki tialo Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tabuaaki ninye te pooki shoto, ekueta ninye etuurori nkang'itie enyena, etusulari isunta enyena, amu elap Olaitoriani ena; intalaku elap te ninye, ntaasa ninye anaa apa enataasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwuang'ie te Babilon olaunoni, o ilo oibung olalem le nkisampuare te nkata enkisampuare; ore te nkaraki ilo alem lo loitorogonyani, keibelekenyakino pooki ng'ae iltung'ana lenye maate, neisikaki pooki ng'ae enkop enye makewan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Errinyunoto e Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enker narreshitoi Israel namirta ilng'atunyo etang'asa olaiguanani te Asiria ainos ninye, ore taata te siadi neguenyita Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon iloik lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku, nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Ng'ura, kayau nanu enkitamioto shumata olaiguanani o enkop enye, anaa apa enaitame nanu olaiguanani le Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kashukoki nanu Israel ewueji enye nedaare, naa kedaa ninye te nchumata e Karmel o tiatua Bashan, neiputakini ninye eyieunoto enye te nchumata oldoinyo le Efraim o tiatua Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore akenya te nena olong'i o teina kata, Olaitoriani ojo, neing'oruni entorroni te Israel, nelai, neing'oruni ng'ok tiatua Yuda, nemetumi hoo nabo; amu kapalaki nanu lelo laleku metaa olpisiai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiguana e Nkai te Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
