        },
        {
          "text": "“Ilepa shomo taarare enkop e Merasaim, nilo aarare lelo oomanya Pekod, taara metuata, tusujai indaikie ninche katukul. Olaitoriani ojo, naa taasa nena pooki naaitanapa nanu iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii oltoilo lo Larrabal atua enkop, o enkidaata kitok! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaji eikuna olnyuntu le nkop pooki pee etudung'oki aagil! Kaji eikuna pee etaa Babilon entoki naitureisho tiatua iloreren! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Airragie apa nanu orreshet te nkaraki iyie, nikimbung'aki iyie Babilon, neitu apa iyie iyiolou; kinotoki apa iyie nikimbung'i, enkaraki nitekeshere iyie Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etabolo Olaitoriani ewueji enye neshumieki imasaa o larrabal, neitayu imasaa o larrabal engoro enye napi, amu eeta Olaitoriani Enkai oo lororani esiaai naas tiatua enkop oo Lkaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarasaki ninye te pooki shoto; tabolo ilchumat lenyena le ndaa; tasoto ninye anaa isotot le nkano, nindaikie ninye tukul; mincho eleku toki te ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taara metuata ilmurran lenyena pooki oingok nchoo ninche edoyio aapuo ewueji neyieng'ishoreki. Oi ninche, amu eewuo enkolong enye, enkata enkitamioto enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enining'o oltoilo lenye eisik te nkop e Babilon, pee eibalunye tiatua Sion elap o Laitoriani Enkai ang, elap te nkaraki enkaji enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 18.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mpotu lelo oong'oroo mbaa meetu aarare Babilon lelo pooki ooriu enkawuo. Entamuat entaman ninye; emincho eluaya hoo obo. Entalaa ninye te risioroto oo nkiaasin enyena, entaasa ninye te risioroto e nena pooki naataasa ninye; amu eisarkionie ninye to lwuasa lenye Olaitoriani, ilo sinyati le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku kebatata ilbarnot lenyena too lkurrot ootumoreki le nkanasa, enye, ore isikarini lenye pooki neidaikieki teina olong, Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura, kaarare nanu iyie, lo tawuasai, Olaitoriani Enkai oo lororani ojo; amu eetuo nkolong'i inono, e nkata naaitameyie nanu iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerrorro ilo wuasa nebatata, nemeetae olodumu ninye aitasheyie, naa kainok nanu enkima too nkanas enye naa kemut pooki toki namanita ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: Eibookoki iltung'ana le Israel enkop o ltung'ana le Yuda tenebo ninche, ore lelo pooki apa ootaraitie ninche neibung'a ninche aakurraki, etanyaita ninche eisho ninche meshomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo olaku ninche naa kegol; Olaitoriani ninye enkarna enye. Kemitu ninye ninche tukul, pee etum aishoo enkop enkiyeng'iyeng, kake enyamali te lelo oomanya Babilon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
