            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Neaku kemany ilouarak le ntim o lng'ojinia Babilon, nebik isidan tiatua ninye; meitoki aatii iltung'ana atua ninye ntarasi, nememanyi too lporori pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 19.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore apa enatotiuo pee enang'aa Enkai Sodom o Gomora o nkang'itie naatashare, Olaitoriani ojo, neijia etiu meitokini aata oltung'ani omanya ine nemeitokini aata oltung'ani obik teine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura, epuonu iltung'ana ooing'uaa enkalo e moikuape; erretena olosho magilani o laiguanak kumok too wuejitin neelakua enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eibung'ita ninche enkawuo o empere; kegogong ninche nemeeta olng'ur. Ore oltoilo le lototo enye etiu anaa enaiposha nailugo; neked ninche mbartan, neishopo anaa oltung'ani lo larrabal pee kiarare iyie, natito e Babilon!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura, ore anaa olng'atuny olotu te ntim e Yordan ajing'aki eluaata oo ntare, kaluam nanu ninche mekueta aaing'uaa Babilon; nagelu nanu meitoria ninye oloba anaa olagelu. Amu kaing'ae laanyaanyukie nanu? Kaing'ae laakesh nanu? Kalo shekut loo ntare oidim aitasho te dukuya nanu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku toning'o enkitobirata naitobira Olaitoriani agilunore Babilon, o yieunot naaipirua ninye agilunore enkop oo Lkaldayo. Esipa ore lelo ooti le luaata enye naa keingirtitori aaya; esipa ore eluaata enye naa keiputukuny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to ltoilo le yararoto e Babilon neigirigiro enkop, ore enkishirata enye nening'ori tiatua iloreren.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
